WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:05.890
- If you lack optimism,
it's game over.

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:07.059
- [DRock] A good one.

00:00:07.059 --> 00:00:10.392
- It's true.
- [DRock] Oh, without a doubt.

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:15.128
- It's just true.

00:00:15.128 --> 00:00:18.227
If you can't look 
for the bright side

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:21.951
or look at the 
glass half full or

00:00:21.951 --> 00:00:24.233
be optimistic 
instead of pessimistic

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:25.776
if you can't do that you just

00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:28.278
absolutely have no 
chance in winning because

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:31.823
it's all how one synthesizes
what's in front of them.

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:33.833
You know what I mean?

00:00:36.823 --> 00:00:38.205
Life's hard enough,

00:00:38.205 --> 00:00:39.164
the game's hard enough,

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:41.750
the market's hard 
enough against you

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:45.482
that if you're against yourself,

00:00:45.482 --> 00:00:47.018
that's too stacked.

00:00:47.018 --> 00:00:48.715
The deck becomes too stacked.

